# AX_LIB_READLINE cross compile version probe
id: E999
draft: true
contributor_id: 2501_91199785
trigger_tool: autoconf|conan|readline
phase: configure
severity: 2
category: autotools, cross-compile, dependency-check, ohos
error_signature: "readline version.*4.3|AX_LIB_READLINE.*cross|ax_cv_lib_readline_version_ok=no"
match_keywords: "AX_LIB_READLINE, AC_RUN_IFELSE, cross compiling, RL_READLINE_VERSION, Conan, plptools"
title: "AX_LIB_READLINE 交叉编译分支固定失败时，以已解析依赖头文件校验后预置缓存结果"
root_cause: "旧版 AX_LIB_READLINE 使用 AC_RUN_IFELSE，交叉编译时不能运行探测程序，并把交叉分支写死为 no；目标机还拒绝运行未签名探测 ELF。即使 Conan 提供了足够版本的 readline，configure 仍误报缺失。"
affected_scope: "使用相同 AX_LIB_READLINE 宏且依赖头文件暴露可比较 RL_READLINE_VERSION 的 Autotools 库；不适用于头文件与链接库版本可能错配、宏检查还包含 ABI/运行语义的项目。"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: "verify-resolved-readline-header-then-preseed-cache"
rec_description: "先从 Conan 依赖包的 include 路径读取 readline/readline.h，解析 RL_READLINE_VERSION，确认达到宏要求；再在 configure 命令中预置 ax_cv_lib_readline_version_ok=yes，并保持链接步骤对实际 readline 库的校验。不能无条件强制 yes，也不能把未签名探测程序当作功能测试。"
rec_command: "verify RL_READLINE_VERSION in Conan readline.h; configure --host=<target> ax_cv_lib_readline_version_ok=yes"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: "conan-recipe"
forbid_1_pattern: "ax_cv_lib_readline_version_ok=yes without header check"
forbid_1_reason: "缓存值不能替代真实依赖版本证据。"
forbid_1_consequence: "旧版本或头库不一致时形成虚假通过。"
similar_to: "cdcd-0.6.6-legacy-autotools-ohos-detection-mismatches（一般 Autotools 检测）；本条聚焦 AX_LIB_READLINE 的版本缓存变量及 Conan 头文件校验"
doc_file: "knowledge/drafts/E999-draft-2501-91199785-plptools.md"
verification_cmd: "W3 plptools-w3-20260930T173000Z: make check 0/0; four installed CLIs 4/4; receipt 12/12 W3_PASS"
last_updated: "2026-10-01"
source_event: "plptools 1.0.26 OHOS PC configure: AX_LIB_READLINE cross result hardcoded no"
authors: "2501_91199785"
metrics_success_count: 1
metrics_fail_count: 0
metrics_confidence: 0.85
